    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fascinating VR virtual reality fighting game. Players will start a fierce confrontation with prisoners on the prison ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new prison guard, you will be ordered by the boss to meet the challenge, and the prisoners around you will become your audience. In this New Year's competition, you will use the handle to control to launch moves, kicking, dodge and other actions, and win the wisdom and fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game provides a variety of modes, including training mode and combat mode, allowing players to challenge according to their preferences and levels. On the ring, both sides have health and energy values. Mobilization of attacks will consume energy, and energy will recover over time. Players need to control the energy value cleverly, and pay attention to protecting their health, because once the life value is exhausted, the opponent will win. Therefore, players need to use strategies and skills flexibly in order to stand out on the ring and win the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will bring players' immersive fighting experience, realistic scenes and smooth operations to immerse the players and feel the real feedback of each action. Challenge your response speed and combat skills, and become the strongest prison guards on this competitive and exciting ring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img] </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operating instructions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left controller: The touchpad is used for movement. Trigger key triggers kick. Grip key to dodge. Menu key to return to the main scene; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right controller: Trigger key triggers fist. Grip key to parry. There will be different movements when using punch, dodging, and kicking while moving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fascinating VR virtual reality fighting game. Players will start a fierce confrontation with prisoners on the prison ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new prison guard, you will be ordered by the boss to meet the challenge, and the prisoners around you will become your audience. In this New Year's competition, you will use the handle to control to launch moves, kicking, dodge and other actions, and win the wisdom and fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game provides a variety of modes, including training mode and combat mode, allowing players to challenge according to their preferences and levels. On the ring, both sides have health and energy values. Mobilization of attacks will consume energy, and energy will recover over time. Players need to control the energy value cleverly, and pay attention to protecting their health, because once the life value is exhausted, the opponent will win. Therefore, players need to use strategies and skills flexibly in order to stand out on the ring and win the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will bring players' immersive fighting experience, realistic scenes and smooth operations to immerse the players and feel the real feedback of each action. Challenge your response speed and combat skills, and become the strongest prison guards on this competitive and exciting ring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img] </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operating instructions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left controller: The touchpad is used for movement. Trigger key triggers kick. Grip key to dodge. Menu key to return to the main scene; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right controller: Trigger key triggers fist. Grip key to parry. There will be different movements when using punch, dodging, and kicking while moving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
